$ npx vitest run src/hooks/useChatScrollAnchor.test.ts src/components/messages/ConversationView.scroll-anchoring.vtid-05319.test.tsx src/pages/messages/GroupChat.new-messages.vtid-05319.test.tsx   # 11 + 8 + 6 passed
